    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who we are</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an indie studio formed by two video game enthusiasts. We are in the <strong>very early stages</strong>, and your feedback is vital in helping us shape the game. Come say hello and share your ideas by joining our community on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animation is hand-drawn using the &quot;rubber hose&quot; technique, for a total immersion in the golden age of animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this wacky world, hunger and thirst are just the beginning! Troublesome little creatures and unexpected dangers will keep you on your toes. You'll have to rely on your ingenuity in crafting to make what you need and get by.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land and sea depths await you! Venture through bizarre lands, dig in pitch-black mines (miner's hat on!), or dive into the abyss with self-built masks or mini-subs to unveil the secrets of ancient submerged wrecks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect the creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bizarre creatures of this world can become your allies! Tame them to help you in exploration and survival. With the right care, you'll see them evolve into even more extravagant and powerful forms!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your custom base, with defenses and workbenches, to incredible vehicles! Assemble mechs to roam the mainland, flying machines to rule the skies, or submarines<strong>\u00a0</strong>for underwater exploration. All with a retro touch!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An axe with eyes? Sure! Chop down trees for building wood, extract precious minerals, and grow bizarre vegetables to never go hungry.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all creatures are friendly, and gigantic bosses await you! Craft vintage-flavored weapons, including guns that look like they're straight out of an old cartoon, and prepare for... well, explosive encounters!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant quirky seeds and tend to your animated saplings. A bountiful harvest is the key to never going hungry and having energy for new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground calls! Arm yourself with your trusty pickaxe and break rocks to extract stones, shiny metals, and other essential resources. Every strike brings you closer to new creations and upgrades for your base and gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Who we are</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are an indie studio formed by two video game enthusiasts. We are in the <strong>very early stages</strong>, and your feedback is vital in helping us shape the game. Come say hello and share your ideas by joining our community on Discord!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Hand-drawn</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every animation is hand-drawn using the &quot;rubber hose&quot; technique, for a total immersion in the golden age of animation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/11193b501c9a683fec5e4d1a1c8db621.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this wacky world, hunger and thirst are just the beginning! Troublesome little creatures and unexpected dangers will keep you on your toes. You'll have to rely on your ingenuity in crafting to make what you need and get by.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/8f3ac021ebdf66e1a5199f79dbbae890.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Land and sea depths await you! Venture through bizarre lands, dig in pitch-black mines (miner's hat on!), or dive into the abyss with self-built masks or mini-subs to unveil the secrets of ancient submerged wrecks.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/004bd9e17fb20aad828bf269eedc174b.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Collect the creatures</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The bizarre creatures of this world can become your allies! Tame them to help you in exploration and survival. With the right care, you'll see them evolve into even more extravagant and powerful forms!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/748f8d1fd332ffbd771c7c499a993602.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From your custom base, with defenses and workbenches, to incredible vehicles! Assemble mechs to roam the mainland, flying machines to rule the skies, or submarines<strong>\u00a0</strong>for underwater exploration. All with a retro touch!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/3f6a7bfbdb682583cdb597260556a57b.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gather resources</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An axe with eyes? Sure! Chop down trees for building wood, extract precious minerals, and grow bizarre vegetables to never go hungry.<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/44a770010e9d5b564ac02f1d240a79fd.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Fight</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not all creatures are friendly, and gigantic bosses await you! Craft vintage-flavored weapons, including guns that look like they're straight out of an old cartoon, and prepare for... well, explosive encounters!<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/e5bb447c4209f627864dc7eb073182bc.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Farm</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Plant quirky seeds and tend to your animated saplings. A bountiful harvest is the key to never going hungry and having energy for new adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/d44bf0009c724c7bbd9758682e6350dd.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Mine</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The underground calls! Arm yourself with your trusty pickaxe and break rocks to extract stones, shiny metals, and other essential resources. Every strike brings you closer to new creations and upgrades for your base and gear!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.poster.avif?t=1751795504\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.webm?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3789230/extras/0cbe9ffbe0612e75c78cd6123d93dc7f.mp4?t=1751795504\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "A unique survival adventure, animated in a 1930s rubber hose style! Fight to survive: capture creatures, farm, mine, and craft everything you need\u2014from gear and vehicles to your base. Explore lands and underwater depths with their shipwrecks, amidst dangers and wonders.",
